  "id": "cit",
  "term": "CIT",
  "definition": "CIT stands for Concealed Information Test, a method used to assess whether someone recognizes information they are trying to hide. It commonly compares responses to one meaningful item against neutral items, often using physiological signals and sometimes behavior such as reaction times to indicate concealed knowledge.",
